{"id": "65783", "title": "牡丹", "author": "虞夫人", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65783.htm", "intro": "富贵风流拔等伦，百花低首拜芳尘。\r\n\r\n画栏绣幄围红玉，云锦霞裳涓翠茵。\r\n\r\n天是有各能盖世，国中无色可为邻。\r\n\r\n名花也自难培植，合费天工万斛春\r\n\r\n我是一株牡丹.不合遇了机缘,从此再不能放下得道二字\r\n\r\n跟风之作,讲的是牡丹转世到异大陆,辗转重证天道的故事.有点小H小虐，理所当然小白，不喜者千万勿入，斗胆邀同好共赏。", "base": "files/article/html/65/65783", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9805887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9805888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9805889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9805890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9805891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9805892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9805893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9805894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9805895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "9805896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "9805897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "9805898.html", "available": false}]}